{"id":"d0116d2c9f5af20f","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-analysis-provability.md","title":"Ordinary and Full Omega Provability in Analysis","display":"df-analysis-provability — Ordinary and Full Omega Provability in Analysis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-analysis-provability","aliases":["89-df-analysis-provability"],"display":"df-analysis-provability — Ordinary and Full Omega Provability in Analysis","depends_on":["[[89-df-analysis-language]]","[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]","[[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]","[[89-df-function]]"],"created":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-analysis-provability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-analysis-provability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-analysis-provability — Ordinary and Full Omega Provability in Analysis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ab645f955c77848\" href=\"?note=8ab645f955c77848\" title=\"89-df-analysis-language\">89-df-analysis-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"508219e8b4c7dadf\" href=\"?note=508219e8b4c7dadf\" title=\"89-df-analysis-omega-theory\">89-df-analysis-omega-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76cab88fafa3b379\" href=\"?note=76cab88fafa3b379\" title=\"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation\">89-df-primitive-recursive-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>所有语法、编码、公理和规则取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ab645f955c77848\" href=\"?note=8ab645f955c77848\" title=\"89-df-analysis-language\">89-df-analysis-language</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"508219e8b4c7dadf\" href=\"?note=508219e8b4c7dadf\" title=\"89-df-analysis-omega-theory\">89-df-analysis-omega-theory</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dec}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{dec}_2\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_2\">\\(g_2\\)</span> 在项/公式码像上的逆，其余输入返回固定失败标记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star_2\">\\(\\star_2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}_2=\\mathsf{ind}^{-1}:\\omega\\to\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}_2=\\mathsf{ind}^{-1}:\\omega\\to\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>数值检查均针对有限代码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf J_{\\mathrm{An}}\">\\(\\mathsf J_{\\mathrm{An}}\\)</span> 为下述带见证公理生成器的函数图；记录标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,8\">\\(0,\\ldots,8\\)</span> 分别保存模式及其全部参数，未命中的输入输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{arg}(t)\">\\(\\mathsf{arg}(t)\\)</span> 对数项取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_2(t)\">\\(g_2(t)\\)</span>，对关系变量取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ind}(t)\">\\(\\mathsf{ind}(t)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 为互异三元关系变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为新鲜一元关系变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L_{U,V},\\mathsf G_{U,V}\">\\(\\mathsf L_{U,V},\\mathsf G_{U,V}\\)</span> 只关系化 PA 图公式，不展开成另含二阶量词的 Add/Mul；故下述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 的矩阵仅含数量词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c,d,i,j,k,n,q,w,y\">\\(a,b,c,d,i,j,k,n,q,w,y\\)</span> 在数值定义中取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cl}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cl}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 等对象公式中取数变量。有限数值检查及其原始递归图表示使用本书最小内部证书约定；绑定变量统一作避免捕获改名。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 为互异三元关系变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为一元关系变量，均按二阶语法的新鲜条件选取；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L_{U,V}(R)\">\\(\\mathsf L_{U,V}(R)\\)</span> 中的码集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 表示其已有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0/1\">\\(0/1\\)</span> 特征关系，不是对象常元。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的数值函数表示沿用同一固定表示环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr E\">\\(\\mathscr E\\)</span>：对下式实际出现的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_f\">\\(p_f\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的元数、有限定义子句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_f\">\\(\\mathcal E_f\\)</span>、先行辅助图环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_f\">\\(\\eta_f\\)</span> 均为已显示数值定义的展开数据，并满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Adm}(f)\">\\(\\mathsf{Adm}(f)\\)</span>。这些数据不得在同一公式的不同位置更换；特别是关系名使用其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0/1\">\\(0/1\\)</span> 特征函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Adm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Adm}\\)</span>、子句满足关系与最小证书选择均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"76cab88fafa3b379\" href=\"?note=76cab88fafa3b379\" title=\"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation\">89-df-primitive-recursive-representation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}provability}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{dec}_2(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}A,&amp;A\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_2,\\ g_2(A)=a,\\\\\n\\star_2,&amp;a\\notin g_2[\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_2],\\end{cases}\\quad\n\\operatorname{var}_2(a)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{ind}^{-1}(a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{arg}(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_2(t),&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2,\\\\\\mathsf{ind}(t),&amp;t\\in\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathsf V_k,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf J_{\\mathrm{An}}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle0,g_2(A)\\rangle,g_2(A))\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Taut}_2\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle1,\\mathsf{ind}(z),g_2(A),\\mathsf{arg}(t)\\rangle,g_2(\\forall zA\\to A[z:=t]))\\mid\ns\\in\\omega,z\\in\\mathsf V_s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_s,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle2,\\mathsf{ind}(z),g_2(A),g_2(B)\\rangle,g_2(\\forall z(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall zB)))\\mid\nA,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\setminus\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle3,g_2(t)\\rangle,g_2(t=t))\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle4,i,g_2(t),g_2(u),g_2(A)\\rangle,g_2(t=u\\to(A[v_i:=t]\\to A[v_i:=u])))\\mid\ni\\in\\omega,t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle5,i\\rangle,g_2(\\forall v_i\\neg(0=Sv_i)))\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle6,i,j\\rangle,g_2(\\forall v_i\\forall v_j(Sv_i=Sv_j\\to v_i=v_j)))\\mid i,j\\in\\omega,i\\ne j\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle7,i,j\\rangle,g_2(\\mathrm{ucl}_2((X_i^{(1)}(0)\\land\\forall v_j(X_i^{(1)}(v_j)\\to X_i^{(1)}(Sv_j)))\\to\\forall v_jX_i^{(1)}(v_j))))\\mid i,j\\in\\omega\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle8,k,i,\\mathsf{seq}(\\vec j),g_2(A)\\rangle,\ng_2(\\mathrm{ucl}_2(\\exists X_i^{(k)}\\forall v_{j_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{j_{k-1}}(X_i^{(k)}(v_{j_0},\\ldots,v_{j_{k-1}})\\leftrightarrow A))))\\mid\nk,i\\in\\omega,\\vec j\\in\\omega^k,\\operatorname{Inj}(\\vec j),A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,X_i^{(k)}\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{AxInst}_{\\mathrm{An}}(q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&amp;(q,a)\\in\\mathsf J_{\\mathrm{An}},\\\\0,&amp;q\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathsf J_{\\mathrm{An}}),\\end{cases}\\quad\n\\mathsf{AxInst}_{\\mathrm{An}}[\\omega]\\setminus\\{0\\}=g_2[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Imp}_2(a,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_2(\\operatorname{dec}_2(a)\\to\\operatorname{dec}_2(b)),&amp;a,b\\in\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\\\0,&amp;a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_2\\lor b\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{All}_2(z,a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_2(\\forall\\operatorname{var}_2(z)\\operatorname{dec}_2(a)),&amp;a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\\\0,&amp;a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{OneNum}_2(a,i)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\ (a=g_2(A)\\land\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{SubNum}_2(a,i,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_2(\\operatorname{dec}_2(a)[v_i:=\\bar n]),&amp;a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\\\0,&amp;a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\end{cases}\\quad\n\\mathsf{AllNum}_2(i,a)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{All}_2(\\mathsf{ind}(v_i),a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Row}_2(z,a,t,d)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow z=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle a,t,d\\rangle\\land a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Good}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\rho,i)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow i&lt;|\\rho|\\land\\exists a,t,d\\ \\bigl[\\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),i),a,t,d)\\land\n\\bigl((t=0\\land a=\\mathsf{AxInst}_{\\mathrm{An}}(d))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(t=1\\land\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ \\exists b,t_j,d_j,t_k,d_k\\\\\n[d=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle j,k\\rangle\\land\\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),j),b,t_j,d_j)\\land\\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),k),\\mathsf{Imp}_2(b,a),t_k,d_k)])\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(t=2\\land\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists z,b,t_j,d_j\\\\\n[d=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle j,z\\rangle\\land\\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),j),b,t_j,d_j)\\land a=\\mathsf{All}_2(z,b)])\\bigr)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Check}_{\\mathrm{An}}(y,x)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n|\\mathsf{unseq}(y)|&gt;0\\land\\exists t,d\\ \\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{last}(y),x,t,d)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\mathsf{unseq}(y)|\\ \\mathsf{Good}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\mathsf{unseq}(y),i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\iota_2(\\exists y\\ G_{p_{\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{Check}_{\\mathrm{An}}}}}(y,x,\\bar1)),\\\\\n\\mathsf L_{U,V}(R)(\\vec a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota_{U,V}(\\mathsf{Arith}(R)(\\vec a)),\\quad\n\\mathsf G_{U,V}(f)(\\vec a,b)\\coloneqq\\iota_{U,V}(G_{p_f}(\\vec a,b)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_f(X,\\vec a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists b(\\mathsf G_{U,V}(f)(\\vec a,b)\\land X(b)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}^{U,V}_{\\mathrm{An}}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\n[\\forall a(X(a)\\to\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{FC}_2)(a))]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land[\\forall q\\forall a((\\mathsf G_{U,V}(\\mathsf{AxInst}_{\\mathrm{An}})(q,a)\\land a\\ne0)\\to X(a))]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land[\\forall a\\forall b((\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{FC}_2)(a)\\land\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{FC}_2)(b)\n\\land X(a)\\land\\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_{\\mathsf{Imp}_2}(X,a,b))\\to X(b))]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land[\\forall a\\forall z((\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{FC}_2)(a)\\land X(a))\\to\\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_{\\mathsf{All}_2}(X,z,a))],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}^{U,V}_{\\mathrm{An},\\omega}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Cl}^{U,V}_{\\mathrm{An}}(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land[\\forall a\\forall i((\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{OneNum}_2)(a,i)\\land\n\\forall n\\ \\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_{\\mathsf{SubNum}_2}(X,a,i,n))\\to\\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_{\\mathsf{AllNum}_2}(X,i,a))],\\\\\nO(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall U\\forall V\\forall X\\bigl[\\mathsf{ArGr}(U,V)\\to\n(\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{SC}_2)(x)\\land(\\mathsf{Cl}^{U,V}_{\\mathrm{An},\\omega}(X)\\to X(x)))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2\\models\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner_2})&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow S\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2\\models O(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner_2})&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow S\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}provability}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{dec}_2(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}A,&amp;A\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_2,\\ g_2(A)=a,\\\\\n\\star_2,&amp;a\\notin g_2[\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_2],\\end{cases}\\quad\n\\operatorname{var}_2(a)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{ind}^{-1}(a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{arg}(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_2(t),&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2,\\\\\\mathsf{ind}(t),&amp;t\\in\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathsf V_k,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf J_{\\mathrm{An}}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle0,g_2(A)\\rangle,g_2(A))\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Taut}_2\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle1,\\mathsf{ind}(z),g_2(A),\\mathsf{arg}(t)\\rangle,g_2(\\forall zA\\to A[z:=t]))\\mid\ns\\in\\omega,z\\in\\mathsf V_s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_s,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle2,\\mathsf{ind}(z),g_2(A),g_2(B)\\rangle,g_2(\\forall z(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall zB)))\\mid\nA,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\setminus\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle3,g_2(t)\\rangle,g_2(t=t))\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle4,i,g_2(t),g_2(u),g_2(A)\\rangle,g_2(t=u\\to(A[v_i:=t]\\to A[v_i:=u])))\\mid\ni\\in\\omega,t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle5,i\\rangle,g_2(\\forall v_i\\neg(0=Sv_i)))\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle6,i,j\\rangle,g_2(\\forall v_i\\forall v_j(Sv_i=Sv_j\\to v_i=v_j)))\\mid i,j\\in\\omega,i\\ne j\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle7,i,j\\rangle,g_2(\\mathrm{ucl}_2((X_i^{(1)}(0)\\land\\forall v_j(X_i^{(1)}(v_j)\\to X_i^{(1)}(Sv_j)))\\to\\forall v_jX_i^{(1)}(v_j))))\\mid i,j\\in\\omega\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle8,k,i,\\mathsf{seq}(\\vec j),g_2(A)\\rangle,\ng_2(\\mathrm{ucl}_2(\\exists X_i^{(k)}\\forall v_{j_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{j_{k-1}}(X_i^{(k)}(v_{j_0},\\ldots,v_{j_{k-1}})\\leftrightarrow A))))\\mid\nk,i\\in\\omega,\\vec j\\in\\omega^k,\\operatorname{Inj}(\\vec j),A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,X_i^{(k)}\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{AxInst}_{\\mathrm{An}}(q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&amp;(q,a)\\in\\mathsf J_{\\mathrm{An}},\\\\0,&amp;q\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathsf J_{\\mathrm{An}}),\\end{cases}\\quad\n\\mathsf{AxInst}_{\\mathrm{An}}[\\omega]\\setminus\\{0\\}=g_2[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Imp}_2(a,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_2(\\operatorname{dec}_2(a)\\to\\operatorname{dec}_2(b)),&amp;a,b\\in\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\\\0,&amp;a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_2\\lor b\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{All}_2(z,a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_2(\\forall\\operatorname{var}_2(z)\\operatorname{dec}_2(a)),&amp;a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\\\0,&amp;a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{OneNum}_2(a,i)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\ (a=g_2(A)\\land\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{SubNum}_2(a,i,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_2(\\operatorname{dec}_2(a)[v_i:=\\bar n]),&amp;a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\\\0,&amp;a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\end{cases}\\quad\n\\mathsf{AllNum}_2(i,a)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{All}_2(\\mathsf{ind}(v_i),a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Row}_2(z,a,t,d)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow z=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle a,t,d\\rangle\\land a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Good}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\rho,i)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow i&lt;|\\rho|\\land\\exists a,t,d\\ \\bigl[\\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),i),a,t,d)\\land\n\\bigl((t=0\\land a=\\mathsf{AxInst}_{\\mathrm{An}}(d))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(t=1\\land\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ \\exists b,t_j,d_j,t_k,d_k\\\\\n[d=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle j,k\\rangle\\land\\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),j),b,t_j,d_j)\\land\\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),k),\\mathsf{Imp}_2(b,a),t_k,d_k)])\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(t=2\\land\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists z,b,t_j,d_j\\\\\n[d=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle j,z\\rangle\\land\\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),j),b,t_j,d_j)\\land a=\\mathsf{All}_2(z,b)])\\bigr)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Check}_{\\mathrm{An}}(y,x)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n|\\mathsf{unseq}(y)|&gt;0\\land\\exists t,d\\ \\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{last}(y),x,t,d)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\mathsf{unseq}(y)|\\ \\mathsf{Good}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\mathsf{unseq}(y),i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\iota_2(\\exists y\\ G_{p_{\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{Check}_{\\mathrm{An}}}}}(y,x,\\bar1)),\\\\\n\\mathsf L_{U,V}(R)(\\vec a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota_{U,V}(\\mathsf{Arith}(R)(\\vec a)),\\quad\n\\mathsf G_{U,V}(f)(\\vec a,b)\\coloneqq\\iota_{U,V}(G_{p_f}(\\vec a,b)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_f(X,\\vec a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists b(\\mathsf G_{U,V}(f)(\\vec a,b)\\land X(b)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}^{U,V}_{\\mathrm{An}}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\n[\\forall a(X(a)\\to\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{FC}_2)(a))]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land[\\forall q\\forall a((\\mathsf G_{U,V}(\\mathsf{AxInst}_{\\mathrm{An}})(q,a)\\land a\\ne0)\\to X(a))]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land[\\forall a\\forall b((\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{FC}_2)(a)\\land\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{FC}_2)(b)\n\\land X(a)\\land\\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_{\\mathsf{Imp}_2}(X,a,b))\\to X(b))]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land[\\forall a\\forall z((\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{FC}_2)(a)\\land X(a))\\to\\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_{\\mathsf{All}_2}(X,z,a))],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}^{U,V}_{\\mathrm{An},\\omega}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Cl}^{U,V}_{\\mathrm{An}}(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land[\\forall a\\forall i((\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{OneNum}_2)(a,i)\\land\n\\forall n\\ \\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_{\\mathsf{SubNum}_2}(X,a,i,n))\\to\\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_{\\mathsf{AllNum}_2}(X,i,a))],\\\\\nO(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall U\\forall V\\forall X\\bigl[\\mathsf{ArGr}(U,V)\\to\n(\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{SC}_2)(x)\\land(\\mathsf{Cl}^{U,V}_{\\mathrm{An},\\omega}(X)\\to X(x)))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2\\models\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner_2})&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow S\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2\\models O(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner_2})&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow S\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>O 由所有对分析公理、有限规则和完整 omega 规则闭合的公式码集合的交集定义。外层仅有三个全称关系量词，矩阵中的语法检查和关系化图公式仅量化数，给出明确的 Π¹₁ 表示。普通 Bew_An 仍检查有限证明；不将它与 O 或 PA 的一次 omegaBew 混同。此处补齐的是原包明确引用却未给出的接口，不宣称逐字重建原书排印公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-analysis-language","status":"resolved","id":"8ab645f955c77848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-analysis-omega-theory","status":"resolved","id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation","status":"resolved","id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-analysis-language","status":"resolved","id":"8ab645f955c77848","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"所有语法、编码、公理和规则取 [[89-df-analysis-language]]、[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]。$\\operatorname{dec}_2$ 是 $g_2$ 在项/公式码像上的逆，其余输入返回固定失败标记 $\\star_2$；$\\operatorname{var}_2=\\mathsf{ind}^{-1}:\\omega\\to\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}$。","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-analysis-omega-theory","status":"resolved","id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"所有语法、编码、公理和规则取 [[89-df-analysis-language]]、[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]。$\\operatorname{dec}_2$ 是 $g_2$ 在项/公式码像上的逆，其余输入返回固定失败标记 $\\star_2$；$\\operatorname{var}_2=\\mathsf{ind}^{-1}:\\omega\\to\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}$。","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation","status":"resolved","id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的数值函数表示沿用同一固定表示环境 $\\mathscr E$：对下式实际出现的每个 $p_f$，$f$ 的元数、有限定义子句 $\\mathcal E_f$、先行辅助图环境 $\\eta_f$ 均为已显示数值定义的展开数据，并满足 $\\mathsf{Adm}(f)$。这些数据不得在同一公式的不同位置更换；特别是关系名使用其 $0/1$ 特征函数。$\\mathsf{Adm}$、子句满足关系与最小证书选择均取 [[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{dec}_2","display":false},{"tex":"g_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\star_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}_2=\\mathsf{ind}^{-1}:\\omega\\to\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf J_{\\mathrm{An}}","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,8","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{arg}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"g_2(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ind}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"U,V","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L_{U,V},\\mathsf G_{U,V}","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c,d,i,j,k,n,q,w,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Cl}","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"U,V","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L_{U,V}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"0/1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr E","display":false},{"tex":"p_f","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Adm}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"0/1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Adm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}provability}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{dec}_2(a)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}A,&A\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_2,\\ g_2(A)=a,\\\\\n\\star_2,&a\\notin g_2[\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_2],\\end{cases}\\quad\n\\operatorname{var}_2(a)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{ind}^{-1}(a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{arg}(t)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_2(t),&t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2,\\\\\\mathsf{ind}(t),&t\\in\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathsf V_k,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf J_{\\mathrm{An}}\\coloneqq{}&\n\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle0,g_2(A)\\rangle,g_2(A))\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Taut}_2\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle1,\\mathsf{ind}(z),g_2(A),\\mathsf{arg}(t)\\rangle,g_2(\\forall zA\\to A[z:=t]))\\mid\ns\\in\\omega,z\\in\\mathsf V_s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_s,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle2,\\mathsf{ind}(z),g_2(A),g_2(B)\\rangle,g_2(\\forall z(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall zB)))\\mid\nA,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\setminus\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle3,g_2(t)\\rangle,g_2(t=t))\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle4,i,g_2(t),g_2(u),g_2(A)\\rangle,g_2(t=u\\to(A[v_i:=t]\\to A[v_i:=u])))\\mid\ni\\in\\omega,t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle5,i\\rangle,g_2(\\forall v_i\\neg(0=Sv_i)))\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle6,i,j\\rangle,g_2(\\forall v_i\\forall v_j(Sv_i=Sv_j\\to v_i=v_j)))\\mid i,j\\in\\omega,i\\ne j\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle7,i,j\\rangle,g_2(\\mathrm{ucl}_2((X_i^{(1)}(0)\\land\\forall v_j(X_i^{(1)}(v_j)\\to X_i^{(1)}(Sv_j)))\\to\\forall v_jX_i^{(1)}(v_j))))\\mid i,j\\in\\omega\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle8,k,i,\\mathsf{seq}(\\vec j),g_2(A)\\rangle,\ng_2(\\mathrm{ucl}_2(\\exists X_i^{(k)}\\forall v_{j_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{j_{k-1}}(X_i^{(k)}(v_{j_0},\\ldots,v_{j_{k-1}})\\leftrightarrow A))))\\mid\nk,i\\in\\omega,\\vec j\\in\\omega^k,\\operatorname{Inj}(\\vec j),A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,X_i^{(k)}\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{AxInst}_{\\mathrm{An}}(q)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&(q,a)\\in\\mathsf J_{\\mathrm{An}},\\\\0,&q\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathsf J_{\\mathrm{An}}),\\end{cases}\\quad\n\\mathsf{AxInst}_{\\mathrm{An}}[\\omega]\\setminus\\{0\\}=g_2[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Imp}_2(a,b)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_2(\\operatorname{dec}_2(a)\\to\\operatorname{dec}_2(b)),&a,b\\in\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\\\0,&a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_2\\lor b\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{All}_2(z,a)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_2(\\forall\\operatorname{var}_2(z)\\operatorname{dec}_2(a)),&a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\\\0,&a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{OneNum}_2(a,i)&\\Longleftrightarrow \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\ (a=g_2(A)\\land\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{SubNum}_2(a,i,n)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_2(\\operatorname{dec}_2(a)[v_i:=\\bar n]),&a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\\\0,&a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\end{cases}\\quad\n\\mathsf{AllNum}_2(i,a)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{All}_2(\\mathsf{ind}(v_i),a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Row}_2(z,a,t,d)&\\Longleftrightarrow z=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle a,t,d\\rangle\\land a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_2,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Good}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\rho,i)&\\Longleftrightarrow i<|\\rho|\\land\\exists a,t,d\\ \\bigl[\\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),i),a,t,d)\\land\n\\bigl((t=0\\land a=\\mathsf{AxInst}_{\\mathrm{An}}(d))\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor(t=1\\land\\exists j,k<i\\ \\exists b,t_j,d_j,t_k,d_k\\\\\n[d=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle j,k\\rangle\\land\\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),j),b,t_j,d_j)\\land\\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),k),\\mathsf{Imp}_2(b,a),t_k,d_k)])\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor(t=2\\land\\exists j<i\\ \\exists z,b,t_j,d_j\\\\\n[d=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle j,z\\rangle\\land\\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),j),b,t_j,d_j)\\land a=\\mathsf{All}_2(z,b)])\\bigr)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Check}_{\\mathrm{An}}(y,x)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n|\\mathsf{unseq}(y)|>0\\land\\exists t,d\\ \\mathsf{Row}_2(\\mathsf{last}(y),x,t,d)\n\\land\\forall i<|\\mathsf{unseq}(y)|\\ \\mathsf{Good}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\mathsf{unseq}(y),i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(x)&\\coloneqq\n\\iota_2(\\exists y\\ G_{p_{\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{Check}_{\\mathrm{An}}}}}(y,x,\\bar1)),\\\\\n\\mathsf L_{U,V}(R)(\\vec a)&\\coloneqq\\iota_{U,V}(\\mathsf{Arith}(R)(\\vec a)),\\quad\n\\mathsf G_{U,V}(f)(\\vec a,b)\\coloneqq\\iota_{U,V}(G_{p_f}(\\vec a,b)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_f(X,\\vec a)&\\coloneqq\\exists b(\\mathsf G_{U,V}(f)(\\vec a,b)\\land X(b)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}^{U,V}_{\\mathrm{An}}(X)&\\coloneqq\n[\\forall a(X(a)\\to\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{FC}_2)(a))]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land[\\forall q\\forall a((\\mathsf G_{U,V}(\\mathsf{AxInst}_{\\mathrm{An}})(q,a)\\land a\\ne0)\\to X(a))]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land[\\forall a\\forall b((\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{FC}_2)(a)\\land\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{FC}_2)(b)\n\\land X(a)\\land\\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_{\\mathsf{Imp}_2}(X,a,b))\\to X(b))]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land[\\forall a\\forall z((\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{FC}_2)(a)\\land X(a))\\to\\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_{\\mathsf{All}_2}(X,z,a))],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}^{U,V}_{\\mathrm{An},\\omega}(X)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Cl}^{U,V}_{\\mathrm{An}}(X)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land[\\forall a\\forall i((\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{OneNum}_2)(a,i)\\land\n\\forall n\\ \\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_{\\mathsf{SubNum}_2}(X,a,i,n))\\to\\mathsf{App}^{U,V}_{\\mathsf{AllNum}_2}(X,i,a))],\\\\\nO(x)&\\coloneqq\\forall U\\forall V\\forall X\\bigl[\\mathsf{ArGr}(U,V)\\to\n(\\mathsf L_{U,V}(\\mathsf{SC}_2)(x)\\land(\\mathsf{Cl}^{U,V}_{\\mathrm{An},\\omega}(X)\\to X(x)))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2\\models\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner_2})&\\Longleftrightarrow S\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2\\models O(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner_2})&\\Longleftrightarrow S\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":8159,"backlinks":[{"id":"43a8d98c9b5fc94d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2$；$\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(x)$、$O(x)$ 精确取 [[89-df-analysis-provability]] 中定义的公式，不替换为任意标准模型外延相同的公式。"},{"id":"571457cbee377421","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$；$O(x)$ 精确取 [[89-df-analysis-provability]] 的全称闭包公式，$r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2$。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-language]]、[[89-df-analysis-provability]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-provability]]"}],"outgoing":["8ab645f955c77848","508219e8b4c7dadf","76cab88fafa3b379","0d71e87a2f416230"]}